# The exact Nibli engine revision this repository verifies against.
#
# `./bootstrap.sh` puts that revision next to this checkout; `./verify.sh`
# builds the native runner from whatever sits at ../nibli and adds no gate of
# its own. Verification checks pins and contradictions, nothing else, so this
# file is a published input rather than a hash anything enforces.
#
# Change it in the same commit that records a measurement against the new
# engine, so the number in README.md and the revision here never disagree.
repository https://github.com/dhilipsiva/nibli.git
revision   b707dad73876f7e1620ea8bb6f80242aa374c759
